This yields
\[
Z_\beta (x) =\frac{A_{\beta}}{(2\pi \beta)^{P/2}}\int_{\mathbb R^P}\mathbb E_{\mathrm{prior}}\left[ \exp\left[ -\frac{\left|\left|t\right|\right|^2}{2\beta}+i\theta_*^TXt-\frac{\sigma^2}{2N_L}\left|\left|X^Lt + x^L\right|\right|^2\right]\right]dt,

